{"4508290":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Lucky Punk: a push your luck Deckbuilder","steam_appid":4508290,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucky Punk is a roguelike deckbuilder built for people who don’t like gambling but love taking risks and owning their decisions. Every turn comes with one simple decision: <strong>DRAW <\/strong>another card and push your luck – or <strong>STOP<\/strong> and play it safe. Where most card battlers<strong> <\/strong>hide randomness or over-use RNG, Lucky Punk always shows you the odds. In a game where every choice matters, every decision in Lucky Punk is transparent, every risk is yours, and well, every failure? Completely deserved. 💀<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4508290\/extras\/d5945e094c85e068d7c20e2146008386.poster.avif?t=1793725301\" width=1170 height=264 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4508290\/extras\/d5945e094c85e068d7c20e2146008386.webm?t=1793725301\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4508290\/extras\/d5945e094c85e068d7c20e2146008386.mp4?t=1793725301\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DRAW… OR STOP<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, you're in the post-apocalypse gathering supplies, and you gotta fight enemies by playing a card game. You start with a deck of nine cards, and the only strategy you need to care about is: ⭐<strong>DAMAGE<\/strong>⭐ versus 🙁<strong>EFFORT<\/strong>🙁.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4508290\/extras\/cea492a3c9c8bbe9e4966904345f408c.avif?t=1793725301\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4508290\/extras_big\/cea492a3c9c8bbe9e4966904345f408c.webp?t=1793725301 width=1560 height=418 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, you do one of two things:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >#1. <strong>Draw a card<\/strong>. You get the Damage and Effort points. The card abilities play out, you know how it is. 🤷<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >#2. <strong>Stop<\/strong> and end the round. You 💢<strong>hit<\/strong> the enemy equal to the Damage you’ve got. Then the enemy <strong>hits <\/strong>you and we go to the next round. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you <i>ever <\/i>get too much Effort? You exhaust yourself. You lose <i>all<\/i> the Damage you’ve built up and the round ends with only you getting a punch in the face! 👊🏻 We do this until they’re down or you’re out. Got it? That’s it! That’s the game. <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FAST RUNS. HARD CHOICES<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a<strong> fast-paced turn-based roguelite<\/strong> built for quick, high stakes runs, constant tension and instant emotional outcomes that will either have you win or fail spectacularly. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After all, the game <strong>always<\/strong> tells you how risky your next draw is. You can even check what's in your deck at <i>any time<\/i>. It's a game about managing luck, but with perfect information. There's no card counting required! Unless you’re into that, you sicko. 😘<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4508290\/extras\/f5f21ae437be7651549bddb1a32bdf52.poster.avif?t=1793725301\" width=1170 height=264 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4508290\/extras\/f5f21ae437be7651549bddb1a32bdf52.webm?t=1793725301\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4508290\/extras\/f5f21ae437be7651549bddb1a32bdf52.mp4?t=1793725301\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So all you really need to do is figure out if in your heart of hearts, that 1 in 5 chance of completely crashing out is worth it or not. What are you willing to risk all your progress on? A 20% chance of failure? What about 50%? No guessing. No excuses. Just you vs. the odds.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PUNK AGAINST THE APOCALYPSE<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4508290\/extras\/7a3a9549f4a0516183f76db4a1334e60.poster.avif?t=1793725301\" width=1170 height=264 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4508290\/extras\/7a3a9549f4a0516183f76db4a1334e60.webm?t=1793725301\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4508290\/extras\/7a3a9549f4a0516183f76db4a1334e60.mp4?t=1793725301\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh and we got here because some business idiot billionaire took it upon himself to &quot;save the world&quot; 🙄 and now we're all living with the consequences. But instead of the usual grimdark gloom, we’ve got a bright 2D comic style, with classic ‘Zipatone’ textures. So you now get to explore this tongue-in-cheek eco-dystopia of sulfur haze. An absolutely vibrant punk-pocalypse full of strange plants and creatures to gather, fight, survive and thrive. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that’s your aim as one of the few idiot punks able and willing to leave the safety of the settlement to gather supplies. Bring back enough, and your community thrives, unlocking new cards and recruiting other weird punks with weirder gameplay styles! And for helping them out, they’ll risk it all, too. 🤘<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4508290\/extras\/19419fb926837855bec62bf8398083ae.poster.avif?t=1793725301\" width=1170 height=264 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4508290\/extras\/19419fb926837855bec62bf8398083ae.webm?t=1793725301\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4508290\/extras\/19419fb926837855bec62bf8398083ae.mp4?t=1793725301\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD WEIRD. BREAK THE ODDS<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The punks aren’t the only thing that’ll change how you play. It's a game full of weird cards, consumables, and unexpected interactions. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The builds actually interlock with each other in different ways, so you'll find new synergies each time you play. Strategies range from normal ones like <strong>Block<\/strong>, to weird ones like rewarding <strong>Exhaustion<\/strong>, to &quot;<i><strong>you can do this?!?!<\/strong><\/i>&quot; ones like marking the back of your cards to help you identify them, you dirty cheater. 😏<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THIS GAME IS FOR YOU, IF YOU…<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love pushing your luck and asking “just one more draw?”<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want full control, see your odds and <strong>own<\/strong> every decision – good or bad<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibe with bold, comic worlds and a rebellious, hope-punk attitude<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy quick rewards and high-stakes runs over long-term planning and slow grind<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like experimenting with wild builds and unexpected synergies<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy games like &quot;Monster Train 2&quot;, &quot;Black Jacket&quot;, &quot;Slay the Spire&quot; or &quot;Dungeons &amp; Degenerate Gamblers&quot;<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your deck from the set of 76 <strong>unique cards<\/strong> built out of interlocking keywords<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from a plethora of 7 <strong>scrappy punks<\/strong> with distinct playstyles, weirdo mechanics and stupid names<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect information<\/strong> lets you agonise over your choices as if it was a kidney stone<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made entirely by foolhardy, hopeful humans. No “AI”<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4508290\/extras\/1a2d3d19a215fc330a1d3b3bf89b84c6.avif?t=1793725301\" width=108 height=108 \/><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucky Punk is a roguelike deckbuilder built for people who don’t like gambling but love taking risks and owning their decisions. Every turn comes with one simple decision: <strong>DRAW <\/strong>another card and push your luck – or <strong>STOP<\/strong> and play it safe. Where most card battlers<strong> <\/strong>hide randomness or over-use RNG, Lucky Punk always shows you the odds. In a game where every choice matters, every decision in Lucky Punk is transparent, every risk is yours, and well, every failure? Completely deserved. 💀<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4508290\/extras\/d5945e094c85e068d7c20e2146008386.poster.avif?t=1793725301\" width=1170 height=264 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4508290\/extras\/d5945e094c85e068d7c20e2146008386.webm?t=1793725301\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4508290\/extras\/d5945e094c85e068d7c20e2146008386.mp4?t=1793725301\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DRAW… OR STOP<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, you're in the post-apocalypse gathering supplies, and you gotta fight enemies by playing a card game. You start with a deck of nine cards, and the only strategy you need to care about is: ⭐<strong>DAMAGE<\/strong>⭐ versus 🙁<strong>EFFORT<\/strong>🙁.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4508290\/extras\/cea492a3c9c8bbe9e4966904345f408c.avif?t=1793725301\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4508290\/extras_big\/cea492a3c9c8bbe9e4966904345f408c.webp?t=1793725301 width=1560 height=418 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, you do one of two things:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >#1. <strong>Draw a card<\/strong>. You get the Damage and Effort points. The card abilities play out, you know how it is. 🤷<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >#2. <strong>Stop<\/strong> and end the round. You 💢<strong>hit<\/strong> the enemy equal to the Damage you’ve got. Then the enemy <strong>hits <\/strong>you and we go to the next round. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you <i>ever <\/i>get too much Effort? You exhaust yourself. You lose <i>all<\/i> the Damage you’ve built up and the round ends with only you getting a punch in the face! 👊🏻 We do this until they’re down or you’re out. Got it? That’s it! That’s the game. <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FAST RUNS. HARD CHOICES<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a<strong> fast-paced turn-based roguelite<\/strong> built for quick, high stakes runs, constant tension and instant emotional outcomes that will either have you win or fail spectacularly. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After all, the game <strong>always<\/strong> tells you how risky your next draw is. You can even check what's in your deck at <i>any time<\/i>. It's a game about managing luck, but with perfect information. There's no card counting required! Unless you’re into that, you sicko. 😘<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4508290\/extras\/f5f21ae437be7651549bddb1a32bdf52.poster.avif?t=1793725301\" width=1170 height=264 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4508290\/extras\/f5f21ae437be7651549bddb1a32bdf52.webm?t=1793725301\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4508290\/extras\/f5f21ae437be7651549bddb1a32bdf52.mp4?t=1793725301\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So all you really need to do is figure out if in your heart of hearts, that 1 in 5 chance of completely crashing out is worth it or not. What are you willing to risk all your progress on? A 20% chance of failure? What about 50%? No guessing. No excuses. Just you vs. the odds.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PUNK AGAINST THE APOCALYPSE<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4508290\/extras\/7a3a9549f4a0516183f76db4a1334e60.poster.avif?t=1793725301\" width=1170 height=264 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4508290\/extras\/7a3a9549f4a0516183f76db4a1334e60.webm?t=1793725301\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4508290\/extras\/7a3a9549f4a0516183f76db4a1334e60.mp4?t=1793725301\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh and we got here because some business idiot billionaire took it upon himself to &quot;save the world&quot; 🙄 and now we're all living with the consequences. But instead of the usual grimdark gloom, we’ve got a bright 2D comic style, with classic ‘Zipatone’ textures. So you now get to explore this tongue-in-cheek eco-dystopia of sulfur haze. An absolutely vibrant punk-pocalypse full of strange plants and creatures to gather, fight, survive and thrive. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that’s your aim as one of the few idiot punks able and willing to leave the safety of the settlement to gather supplies. Bring back enough, and your community thrives, unlocking new cards and recruiting other weird punks with weirder gameplay styles! And for helping them out, they’ll risk it all, too. 🤘<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4508290\/extras\/19419fb926837855bec62bf8398083ae.poster.avif?t=1793725301\" width=1170 height=264 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4508290\/extras\/19419fb926837855bec62bf8398083ae.webm?t=1793725301\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4508290\/extras\/19419fb926837855bec62bf8398083ae.mp4?t=1793725301\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD WEIRD. BREAK THE ODDS<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The punks aren’t the only thing that’ll change how you play. It's a game full of weird cards, consumables, and unexpected interactions. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The builds actually interlock with each other in different ways, so you'll find new synergies each time you play. Strategies range from normal ones like <strong>Block<\/strong>, to weird ones like rewarding <strong>Exhaustion<\/strong>, to &quot;<i><strong>you can do this?!?!<\/strong><\/i>&quot; ones like marking the back of your cards to help you identify them, you dirty cheater. 😏<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THIS GAME IS FOR YOU, IF YOU…<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love pushing your luck and asking “just one more draw?”<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want full control, see your odds and <strong>own<\/strong> every decision – good or bad<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibe with bold, comic worlds and a rebellious, hope-punk attitude<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy quick rewards and high-stakes runs over long-term planning and slow grind<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like experimenting with wild builds and unexpected synergies<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy games like &quot;Monster Train 2&quot;, &quot;Black Jacket&quot;, &quot;Slay the Spire&quot; or &quot;Dungeons &amp; Degenerate Gamblers&quot;<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your deck from the set of 76 <strong>unique cards<\/strong> built out of interlocking keywords<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from a plethora of 7 <strong>scrappy punks<\/strong> with distinct playstyles, weirdo mechanics and stupid names<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect information<\/strong> lets you agonise over your choices as if it was a kidney stone<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made entirely by foolhardy, hopeful humans. No “AI”<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"ht